Package: tidycrates
Type: Package
Title: Tidy Data from the 'Discogs' API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Massimiliano", "Canzi", , "massimiliano.canzi@uni-konstanz.de", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6124-0321"))
Description: Sends requests to the 'Discogs' API
    <https://www.discogs.com/developers> and returns the results as tidy
    tibbles. Releases, master releases, artists and labels can be read from
    the 'Discogs' database, along with the releases of an artist or label
    and the versions of a master release. The collection and wantlist of a
    user can be listed, tallied and plotted. Tracklists, credits, formats
    and identifiers of releases can be unnested into one row per item.
    Requests can be made with a personal access token or without one. They
    are spaced out to stay within the rate limit of the API and retried
    when the limit is exceeded. Responses can be cached for the session,
    and paginated results can be fetched in full.
